msgid "Resolves Russian domains directly, without going through the proxy. You may add several — MultiDNS races all of them, without it the first entry is used. A bare IP is queried over UDP with TCP fallback; entries may force a transport: tcp://IP, or an encrypted direct DoH URL like https://1.1.1.1/dns-query (never proxied)."
