msgid "\"No rule\" does NOT mean \"straight into the Russian internet\": it only removes the rule — the domains are not added to any proxy list and follow the GENERAL routing rules (mass lists like Russia Inside / Re-filter and learned records may still send them through the node). Only traffic unmatched by every rule egresses directly."
