msgid "What the router SEES right now: live flows (conntrack, TCP and UDP — including QUIC and STUN classes, IPv6 explicitly), Clash connections with hostnames, recent TLS SNI names, and the IP↔DNS mapping. This is the shared source the automation engine learns from and the Service profiles use for passive QUIC observation. Blind zones are listed honestly below the snapshot."
